9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:32,340
three of us entered the magnetic field with our weapons

10
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,580
in search of Professor Stein and Miss Marie.

11
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:38,860
Waiting for us inside the field was a scene from the past,

12
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,780
frozen in time by that long-ago explosion.

13
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:48,160
I'm falling down to my shadow.

14
00:00:48,160 --> 00:01:02,080
I'm falling down to my shadow.

15
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:10,540
Let's do the opposite.

16
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:26,020
See you in your dreams, yeah, baby

17
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:33,260
怖い夢だとしても

18
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:36,900
テレブル君のために

19
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:42,700
星を砕き飾り付けた

20
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:44,340
Black paper

21
00:01:44,340 --> 00:01:47,960
知りてくれたなら

22
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:52,980
When you're lost in one year

23
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:56,300
Forever with your soul

24
00:01:56,300 --> 00:02:00,220
見上げれば輝く

25
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:02,540
月のように

26
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:38,580
Dammit, they just keep on coming

27
00:02:38,580 --> 00:02:40,140
