31
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,080
We'll watch your back

32
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:49,020
Okay, make sure I'm covered

33
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:50,780
You ready, Jackie?

34
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:51,500
Yeah

35
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:55,720
