36
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:58,220
Let's go, I got it

37
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:00,780
Resonance Link

38
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:06,780
Change Pixie!

39
00:03:06,780 --> 00:03:20,780
