40
00:03:20,780 --> 00:03:27,760
Royal Thunder

41
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:30,540
Flash of Lightning

42
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:33,540
Thunder Combination

43
00:03:33,540 --> 00:03:42,140
Good job, you guys

44
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:42,600
Thanks

45
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,480
Okay, now it's our turn, Jackie

46
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:52,320
