Welcome

52
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:19,480
We have plans for you

53
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:24,160
One more step

54
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:27,340
Now

55
00:04:27,340 --> 00:04:28,880
That's gunpowder

56
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:34,200
Spikes

57
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:40,580
All right, Nagus, I've got it

58
00:04:40,580 --> 00:04:41,300
Do it

59
