Will!

60
00:04:54,680 --> 00:05:06,980
Die

61
00:05:06,980 --> 00:05:19,140
i get it now if all teachers at the academy are like you i can see how blackstar became the

62
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:27,400
fighter he is you're a true professional samurai i can respect that what i don't get is why you'd

63
