it's over we're being called off i have no more reason to attack you now

67
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:06,280
you can put down your sword and end this what'll it be

68
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:14,280
of course it may be safer to finish me if we do meet up again you may not be able to escape

69
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:19,080
i'll take that chance

70
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:21,640
go on

71
