133
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:51,300
it's all right though

134
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:53,480
that can be fixed

135
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:57,260
shaving off a few years should give me plenty of time

136
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:59,860
four hundred perhaps

137
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:02,980
no no one hundred should be enough

138
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:22,900
go ahead call me old now

139
