187
00:12:20,660 --> 00:12:21,740
wake up kid!

188
00:12:22,740 --> 00:12:23,700
right i know

189
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,860
we've got to take care of this guy first

190
00:12:25,860 --> 00:12:31,480
