245
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:32,080
Azusa

246
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,520
gather 10 people who can make the trek with me

247
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:35,100
Sid!

248
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:37,160
with those injuries you shouldn't

249
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,300
Nygus

250
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:40,440
quickly see to my injuries

251
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,680
all right

252
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:47,140
after the first wave our technique suffered a little bit

253
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:49,580
the enemy was rather strong but still

254
00:14:49,580 --> 00:14:50,880
