270
00:15:39,740 --> 00:15:42,380
if you disobey orders you will be punished!

271
00:15:42,380 --> 00:15:44,080
i'll expel you!

272
00:15:46,580 --> 00:15:48,180
what are we gonna do now, Hawks?

273
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:50,080
you can't get expelled from the academy

274
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:53,760
i don't think we have much choice in the matter, harver

275
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:57,460
none at all

276
00:15:57,460 --> 00:15:59,800
academy students protect their own

277
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:00,800
simple as that

278
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:14,440
they don't let brand new teachers go around expelling students

279
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:20,360
nothing threatening to stop them from going anyway

280
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:22,360
i can't even do that

281
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:25,800
they don't let brand new teachers go around expelling students

282
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:29,560
not the threatening to stop them from going anyway

283
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:33,860
i'm an adult

284
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:35,440
i'm their teacher

285
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:37,260
i can't do anything

286
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:40,140
what do i do?

287
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:41,700
